+### Export Directory
+
+Set the default local directory for `remarkable_export_markdown` output:
+
+```json
+{
+  "servers": {
+    "remarkable": {
+      "command": "uvx",
+      "args": ["remarkable-mcp", "--ssh"],
+      "env": {
+        "REMARKABLE_EXPORT_DIR": "/path/to/your/notes"
+      }
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Default is `~/remarkable-exports/`. The directory is created automatically if it doesn't exist.
